.\" Begin generated content:
.TH "swaybg" "1" "2026-02-26"
.PP
.SH "نام (NAME)"
.PP
swaybg \- Background for Wayland
.PP
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.PP
\fBswaybg\fR [options.\&.\&.\&]
.PP
Displays a background image on all outputs of your Wayland session.\&
.PP
Without an output specified, appearance options apply to all outputs.\&
Per-output appearance options can be set by passing \fI-o, --output\fR followed by
these options.\&
.PP
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.PP
\fB-c, --color\fR <[#]rrggbb>
.RS 4
Set the background color.\&
.PP
.RE
\fB-h, --help\fR
.RS 4
Show help message and quit.\&
.PP
.RE
\fB-i, --image\fR <path>
.RS 4
Set the background image.\&
.PP
.RE
\fB-m, --mode\fR <mode>
.RS 4
Scaling mode for images: \fIstretch\fR, \fIfill\fR, \fIfit\fR, \fIcenter\fR, or \fItile\fR.\&
Default is \fIstretch\fR.\& Use the additional mode \fIsolid_color\fR to display
only the background color, even if a background image is specified.\&
.PP
.RE
\fB-o, --output\fR <name>
.RS 4
Select an output to configure.\& Subsequent appearance options will only
apply to this output.\& The special value \fI*\fR selects all outputs.\&
.PP
.RE
\fB-v, --version\fR
.RS 4
Show the version number and quit.\&
.PP
.RE
.SH "نویسندگان (AUTHORS)"
.PP
Maintained by Simon Ser <contact@emersion.\&fr>, who is assisted by other open
